# Security and GDPR

- OFFICIAL and SECRET must stay isolated (credentials, browser profiles, settings scopes).
- No telemetry by default. Explicit consent before storing extracted document data.
- Easy local data deletion is a product requirement.
- Confirm with the human before changing security-level handling.
- Manual invoke: `@security-levels` when working on isolation.
